---
// FAQ.astro
---

<section class="faq" id="faq">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="faq-inner">
      <div class="faq-left">
        <span class="eyebrow reveal">Questions</span>
        <h2 class="faq-headline reveal reveal-delay-1">
          STRAIGHT<br/>ANSWERS.
        </h2>
        <p class="faq-sub reveal reveal-delay-2">No runaround. No marketing speak. Just honest answers to what's actually on your mind.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-list reveal reveal-delay-1">
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>
            <span class="faq-q">How do I know the guarantee is actually real?</span>
            <span class="faq-toggle"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14"><path d="M7 1v12M1 7h12"/></svg></span>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>Because we put it in writing and refund every dollar if we don't deliver. We offer the guarantee because we're confident in the system — not to sound good. If you're not in the top 3 at 90 days, we process your full $1,500 refund. No runaround.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>
            <span class="faq-q">What does $1,500 actually cover?</span>
            <span class="faq-toggle"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14"><path d="M7 1v12M1 7h12"/></svg></span>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>Everything. Full GBP rebuild, citation cleanup and building, review generation system, content optimization, local authority signals, technical fixes, and 90 days of ongoing management. One payment. No monthly bills ever.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>
            <span class="faq-q">Will this work for my specific business?</span>
            <span class="faq-toggle"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14"><path d="M7 1v12M1 7h12"/></svg></span>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>If you have a physical location and customers who find businesses on Google, yes. We've ranked restaurants, contractors, salons, insurance offices, and retail stores. Local SEO follows the same fundamentals across industries — and we know those fundamentals cold.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>
            <span class="faq-q">When will I actually start seeing results?</span>
            <span class="faq-toggle"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14"><path d="M7 1v12M1 7h12"/></svg></span>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>Most clients see ranking movement in the first 30 days. Top 3 is the 90-day target. You'll see weekly updates the entire time so you're never left wondering what's happening.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>
            <span class="faq-q">How much of my time does this take?</span>
            <span class="faq-toggle"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14"><path d="M7 1v12M1 7h12"/></svg></span>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>About 30 minutes upfront to get access and understand your business. After that, we handle everything. Weekly updates take you five minutes to read. That's it.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>
            <span class="faq-q">What if I want my money back?</span>
            <span class="faq-toggle"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14"><path d="M7 1v12M1 7h12"/></svg></span>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>Reach out. We check the rankings. If you're not in the top 3 at 90 days, we process the full refund. We keep it simple because we don't plan on issuing any.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
